                  },
                  "style": "link"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "s_030afaaa1e",
            "type": "prose",
            "data": {
              "body": "<p>How we work Manuscripts arrive by post. We read them away from a screen, answer every one, and take on two a year. An accepted book is edited over eight months, set in metal for the title pages, and printed in runs of nine hundred. Nothing is reprinted. When a run is gone the book stays gone, which keeps the shelf honest and the workshop quiet.</p>"
            }
          },
